  "description": "<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"274\">Gear.Club Unlimited is een racespel voor de Nintendo Switch waarin spelers een uitgebreide autocollectie kunnen beheren en racen op diverse circuits. De game biedt verschillende uitdagingen en voertuigen om mee te racen.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"285\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"304\"><strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"304\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"321\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"452\">\r\n<li data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"351\">\r\n<p data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"351\">⭐ Spannende race-ervaring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"377\">\r\n<p data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"377\">⭐ Grote autocollectie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"418\">\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"418\">⭐ Geschikt voor fans van racespellen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"452\">⭐ Leuke gameplay op de Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"474\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<li data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"508\">\r\n<p data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"508\"><strong data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"490\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"560\">\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"560\"><strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"520\">Game:</strong> <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">Gear.Club Unlimited</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"584\">\r\n<p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"584\"><strong data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"573\">Genre:</strong> Racegame</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"614\"><strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"597\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-sta